## Quick rules

- Match layout, spacing, typography, colors, hierarchy, icons, shadows, radius, RTL.
- Do not invent colors, spacing, radius, or components.
- Reuse design tokens and `src/components/` shared components.
- Theme: Settings → מראה (בהיר / כהה / לפי המכשיר) — immediate, local storage.
- Visual changes only unless logic change is explicitly requested.
- If Figma is unclear — ask; never guess.

## End of every UI task

Report: frame inspected, screens/components/tokens changed, remaining diffs, RTL + Light + Dark verified.
